{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22133","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 四 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"车家采桑妇，雨来苦愁悲。\n蔟蚕北堂前，雨冷不成丝。\n西家荷锄叟，雨来亦怨咨。\n种豆南山下，雨多落爲萁。\n而我独何幸，酝酒本无期。\n及此多雨日，正遇新熟时。\n开缾泻尊中，玉液黄金脂。\n持玩已可悦，欢尝有余滋。\n一酌发好容，再酌开愁眉。\n连延四五酌，酣畅入四肢。\n忽然遗我物，谁复分是非。\n是时连夕雨，酩酊无所知。\n人心苦颠倒，反爲忧者嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}